  "details": "Description\n\nThe halloween broomstick that makes you able to fly around on pc and vr bugs out. After you use it, it'll stop you from being able to move completely until you leave the world. This has also happened to a friend of mine who is using a separate avatar.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nthe only work around I can find is leaving and rejoining the worlds completely which is irritating. I have tried using other work arounds for it but nothing else other than that seems to work.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-10_11-22-33.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_b4846645-f00c-41da-84bc-bc7a310d9aac/1/file)",
